{"title":"2022 OIM Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be an acute triangle with circumcircle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> be points on the half-plane defined by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> that contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c4513c51b21ded24a893c497f1c571a10e1b69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"18\" /> are tangent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bfe667b630fabf271f7f86ef401a419c1d7f3f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PB = BC = CQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/859ccf4cd60c7bc6b8fa1afc9a42dc811a826d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be points on the external bisector of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39a4406ab9a6a9f1d35009c2e18008d1888fc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAB$\" width=\"54\" height=\"13\" />, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7add42767f88fb6f3ab8709086f4ce20b973698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BK = BA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/4/81443ca1f51db41a44bac2ff45d95d77c2f5c548.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CL = CA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> be the point of intersection of lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/e/8cef65b28328af6d55985daf18f0d621ef761bda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PK$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cabfaec03d584876eeb289a3ab1d8e1a76d28a23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QL$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" />. Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/d/1adc75d7808ea4a58adf04c2a8963e12fcfc5b8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MK = ML$\" width=\"92\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_OIM_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/uan.edu.co/oim-2022/inicio\">https://sites.google.com/uan.edu.co/oim-2022/inicio</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018021915\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 111/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3221/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.755      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.755      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki